<newsitem itemid="26971" id="root" date="1996-09-02" xml:lang="en">
<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Sasfin lifts year earnings.</title>
<headline>Sasfin lifts year earnings.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr ended June 30</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     45.5	  vs 33.0</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 18.5	  vs 13.5</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   6.13	  vs 4.20</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   7.23	  vs 4.81</p>
<p>    Tax			 1.06	  vs 0.58</p>
<p>Div payable November 6</p>
<p>on register September 27</p>
<p>Full name: Sasfin Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - Sasfin said it would offer capitalisation shares in lieu of the cash dividend.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
